        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: True Williams, Tom Sawyer, Huckleberry Finn, Mark Twain\n- Works: The Adventures of Tom Sawyer\n- Topics: Illustration, Fictional characters\n\nFacts:\n- In 1876, The Adventures of Tom Sawyer was published.\n- In 1876, Mark Twain's novel The Adventures of Tom Sawyer introduced Thomas \"Tom\" Sawyer as its title character.\n- In 1876, True Williams drew all illustrations for the first edition of The Adventures of Tom Sawyer.\n- True Williams was the first illustrator to depict Tom Sawyer and Huckleberry Finn.",
